; effect4_kit -- the agent's native kit (README.md). kit_gen.ml is GENERATED by `make gen-lcnf`
; from ocaml/gen/roots.json: Lean's call tree at a budget (Effect4.Run.Tree) and its runs, and
; Lean's checker (Effect4.Api.typeOf, Effect4.Api.explain). The other modules are hand-written
; host code over it: the library's face (kit.ml), and the command-line driver (bin/).

